        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Rejuvenation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nSetting right the injustice that led to Finley's death (as described in Putting Finley to Rest) allows them to move on to the afterlife. Otherwise, when the ghost is destroyed, they re-form, fully healed, after 2d4 days at the location to which they're bound."
            },
            "id": "f9e6b1de-d2dd-4f06-8477-907ea76df414",
